# Line endings: LF in the repository and in every working tree, whatever a machine's
# core.autocrlf says. Without this, a Windows clone held a mix of CRLF and LF files and
# `git status` listed untouched files as modified (2026-11-12).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.parquet binary

# GitHub's language bar counts bytes, and the three notebooks (3.3 MB with their outputs) made
# the repository read as 87% "Jupyter Notebook". They are the narrated teaching surface; the
# code is the Python under src/, views/ and tests/.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
